      "heading": "TikTok skips ads that look like ads",
      "items": [
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "THE PROBLEM",
          "role": "sec-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "TikTok skips ads that look like ads"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Polished TV-style videos and recycled Instagram banners usually get scrolled past on TikTok in the first second. The platform rewards content that looks native: vertical, fast, with a real person talking and a clear hook at the start."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "The second problem is data. Without TikTok Pixel and correct events, campaigns optimise for cheap views, and you get reach without enquiries. A TikTok ads agency has to fix both sides at once: the creative approach and the signals the algorithm learns from."
        }
      ]
